**Data flow:**
1. User visits `localhost:5173` -> Bun serves `index.html`
2. React app mounts, `useSession()` checks auth with better-auth (API call to backend)
3. If not authenticated -> `AuthPage` renders sign-in/sign-up form
4. If authenticated -> `NotificationPage` renders, fetches `/api/notification/users/:id/notifications?limit=50` (proxied to backend on port 3000)
5. SSE connection opens to `/api/notification/users/:id/notifications/stream` for real-time updates
6. Notifications appear with type indicators (info/warning/error), can be marked read or dismissed locally
7. Connection status badge shows live/disconnected/connecting state with exponential backoff reconnection
